1
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:03,500
I'm trash that doesn't deserve you?

2
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:06,458
Isn’t that the truth?

3
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:07,625
The truth?

4
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:10,458
Livia,

5
00:00:11,083 --> 00:00:12,791
everything you
have, I gave you.

6
00:00:14,041 --> 00:00:16,791
The power I hold
is beyond your comprehension.

7
00:00:18,833 --> 00:00:21,875
You should spend your
whole life on your knees.

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,041
Enough!

9
00:00:24,125 --> 00:00:25,500
The engagement's over.

10
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,250
Your delusions change nothing.

11
00:00:28,791 --> 00:00:29,625
You're a joke.

12
00:00:30,041 --> 00:00:32,000
All of Golantis will laugh at you!

13
00:00:33,916 --> 00:00:34,666
A joke?

14
00:00:35,041 --> 00:00:37,958
Not a single person here is worthy of laughing at me.

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,500
You’re nothing but a lowly miner.

16
00:00:46,916 --> 00:00:50,000
Any one of us here
could crush you without effort.

17
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,833
Redmond, he’s actually
right about one thing.

18
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,625
Those two miners
he dragged here 

19
00:00:57,791 --> 00:01:00,291
are just as low as he is.

20
00:01:02,375 --> 00:01:04,791
Of course they aren’t
qualified to laugh at him.

21
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:06,958
Oh, I get it now!

22
00:01:09,250 --> 00:01:13,291
You brought your little
dirt-buddies so you wouldn't

23
00:01:13,291 --> 00:01:15,625
feel like the biggest
loser in the room!

24
00:01:19,708 --> 00:01:20,500
Smart!

25
00:01:23,083 --> 00:01:23,833
Hey!

26
00:01:26,625 --> 00:01:29,625
We break our backs
to earn honest money!

27
00:01:31,416 --> 00:01:32,833
We’re not ashamed of it.

28
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:38,750
No right?

29
00:01:39,083 --> 00:01:41,625
Did this garbage just
talk back to me?

30
00:01:46,625 --> 00:01:48,333
You know I'm right!

31
00:01:52,750 --> 00:01:53,500
Right?

32
00:01:56,583 --> 00:02:00,916
I could kill you right here, and no one would stop me.
